Alright, everybody. Let's talk numbers. Michael wants a status update on compute costs for the Rufflo Agent Fleet transformation under the Munderdiffl.in Company OS sandbox environment. As Chief Financial Officer, I have run the exact numbers through our transactional ledger. 

Here is my official financial ledger and compute unit economics analysis, structured to meet our strict corporate budget-gating policies.

